<code>assert (\result != -1 && this.get(\result) != null) => Objects.equals(o, this.get(\result));</code>

This assert statement checks that if the result of `lastIndexOf` is not -1 and the element at the result index is not null, then the element at that index must be equal to the specified element `o`.
